sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Logged-in Customer
    participant Gateway as Nginx Gateway (:80)
    participant IS as integration-service (8084)
    participant LLM as Hosted LLM API (Claude / Anthropic)
    participant PS as parcel-service (8082)
    participant OS as operations-service (8083)

    Customer->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/assistant/chat { "message": "Where is my parcel SD-20261024-817293?" }<br>Header: Authorization: Bearer <Customer-JWT>
    Gateway->>IS: Forward with Authorization Header
    IS->>IS: Validate JWT & check per-user rate limit
    IS->>IS: Enforce message length <= 500 chars
    
    IS->>LLM: Call Claude API with user prompt + Tool Declarations<br>(get_parcel_status, estimate_fee, list_my_recent_parcels)
    LLM-->>IS: Response: Tool Call `get_parcel_status(trackingNo: "SD-20261024-817293")`
    
    IS->>PS: GET /api/v1/parcels/{id} OR /api/v1/tracking/{trackingNo}<br>Header: Authorization: Bearer <Customer-JWT>
    Note over IS,PS: parcel-service verifies caller ownership: customer can only query their own parcels
    PS-->>IS: 200 OK { trackingNumber, status: "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY", courier: "Nuwan" }
    
    IS->>LLM: Return Tool Output: { status: "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY", courier: "Nuwan" }
    LLM-->>IS: Final text: "Your parcel SD-20261024-817293 is currently Out for Delivery with courier Nuwan."
    IS-->>Customer: 200 OK { "reply": "Your parcel SD-20261024-817293 is currently...", "conversationId": "..." }
